  📗
    The media type for a file called *name*, by what follows the last dot of
    the name, whatever its case: text/html; charset=utf-8 for index.HTML.
    Types that are text say that they are UTF-8. A name with no extension, or
    with one the table does not have, is application/octet-stream.
